title: "cybersec-toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Modular installer for 670+ cybersecurity tools on Linux and Termux, bundled
  with a vendor-neutral Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that lets any
  MCP-capable AI client query the registry and drive installed tools through a
  governed execution path.
